| control | actual complete updates | actual score sum | actual last change | converged |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| zero budget | 0 | 1.000000000000 | 0.00000e+00 | false |
| one update | 1 | 1.000000000000 | 4.25000e-01 | false |
| all dangling | 1 | 1.000000000000 | 0.00000e+00 | true |
| zero damping | 1 | 1.000000000000 | 0.00000e+00 | true |
